{
  "id": "lesson-yarn-npm-004",
  "slug": "workspaces-monorepos",
  "title": "Workspaces and Monorepos",
  "description": "Manage multiple packages in a single repository with workspaces.",
  "order": 4,
  "difficulty": "beginner",
  "estimatedMinutes": 10,
  "tags": [
    "npm",
    "yarn",
    "package-manager",
    "fundamentals"
  ],
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "data": {
        "text": "Monorepos host multiple packages in a single repository. Workspaces allow package managers to link local packages and hoist shared dependencies."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "data": {
        "text": "Why Monorepos?",
        "level": "h2"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "bullet-list",
      "data": {
        "items": [
          "Single version control for related packages",
          "Easier cross-package refactoring",
          "Shared tooling and configuration",
          "Atomic commits across packages"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "callout",
      "data": {
        "variant": "info",
        "title": "Common Use Case",
        "text": "A design system monorepo might contain the core component library, documentation site, and Storybook in one repository."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "data": {
        "text": "Yarn Workspaces",
        "level": "h3"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "example",
      "data": {
        "language": "json",
        "caption": "Root package.json with workspaces",
        "code": "{\n  \"private\": true,\n  \"workspaces\": [\n    \"packages/*\",\n    \"apps/*\"\n  ]\n}"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "data": {
        "text": "Yarn hoists dependencies to the root node_modules when possible, reducing duplication. Packages reference each other via the workspace protocol."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "data": {
        "text": "NPM Workspaces",
        "level": "h3"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "example",
      "data": {
        "language": "json",
        "caption": "Root package.json with NPM workspaces",
        "code": "{\n  \"private\": true,\n  \"workspaces\": [\n    \"packages/*\",\n    \"apps/*\"\n  ]\n}"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "data": {
        "text": "NPM workspaces work similarly but historically had fewer features than Yarn. Modern NPM versions have caught up significantly."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "comparison-cards",
      "data": {
        "items": [
          {
            "title": "Yarn Workspaces",
            "description": "First-class support, PnP ready, hoisting by default, fast installs."
          },
          {
            "title": "NPM Workspaces",
            "description": "Built-in, no extra setup, improving performance, standard lockfile."
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "data": {
        "headers": [
          "Feature",
          "Yarn",
          "NPM"
        ],
        "rows": [
          [
            "Workspaces",
            "Yes",
            "Yes"
          ],
          [
            "Hoisting",
            "Yes",
            "Yes"
          ],
          [
            "PnP Support",
            "Yes",
            "No"
          ],
          [
            "Install Speed",
            "Very Fast",
            "Fast"
          ],
          [
            "Protocol Linking",
            "workspace:",
            "workspace:"
          ]
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "key-terms",
      "data": {
        "terms": [
          {
            "term": "Monorepo",
            "definition": "A single repository containing multiple packages."
          },
          {
            "term": "Workspace",
            "definition": "A package within a monorepo."
          },
          {
            "term": "Hoisting",
            "definition": "Moving dependencies to the root to deduplicate."
          },
          {
            "term": "PnP",
            "definition": "Plug'n'Play, Yarn's alternative to node_modules."
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "summary-box",
      "data": {
        "title": "Key Takeaways",
        "items": [
          {
            "text": "Monorepos simplify multi-package development."
          },
          {
            "text": "Workspaces link local packages automatically."
          },
          {
            "text": "Both Yarn and NPM support workspaces."
          },
          {
            "text": "Choose based on ecosystem needs and tooling."
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "moduleSlug": "yarn-npm-fundamentals",
